  "schema": "arcpuzzles-parametric-prototype-evidence-v1",
  "scope": "# Review: 54a83e6bbc20 \u2014 jigsaw assembly order\n\nTask: original ARC training:18447a8d; unchanged production generator v4.0.0.\nChange: runnable proposed assembly_order prototype with canonical and reversed-band settings.\nTests: 22 focused tests pass; every produced label is executed in its matching Racket rule.\nTeaching: two 3-demo/4-query episodes; 14 Racket labels; all 8 queries identified among 19 programs.\nSemantics: 24 actual Racket evaluations cover canonical fixtures, 2/3/4-piece cases, and anchor dependencies.\nCounts: independent 3..32 demos and 1..32 queries; 32/32 boundary exercised with 64 distinct inputs.\nAuthority: canonical generator and ledger unchanged; alternate rule changes one band-origin clause.\nLimits: fixed 3-row/5-column pieces and finite rivals; proposed variant has no approval or training admission.\nDisposition: routine isolated prototype handoff; both bounded supplementary tickets completed.\n",
